("21875451", "researcher", 1, "histamine concentration in tuna was found to be 4900 mg/kg, almost 50-fold higher than the concentration allowed",
 ("In the 2010 Dakar scombroid outbreak, how did histamine in the yellowfin tuna compare with the European limit?", ["Just under the limit", "About 50 times higher", "About 2 times higher", "It was undetectable"],
  "Histamine reached 4900 mg/kg, almost 50-fold above European limits, while no bacteria were found in leftovers.", "~50× over."),
 ("En el brote escombroide de Dakar de 2010, ¿cómo se comparó la histamina del atún aleta amarilla con el límite europeo?", ["Apenas bajo el límite", "Unas 50 veces mayor", "Unas 2 veces mayor", "Era indetectable"],
  "La histamina llegó a 4900 mg/kg, casi 50 veces el límite europeo, y no se hallaron bacterias en los restos.", "~50 veces más.")),

